#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:65
#: 063e6171adf4462d8c2a8fb2f8d66a14
msgid "Clock"
msgstr "Clock"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:67
#: 4526e9455929483cbb7d749ecac6bdec
msgid ""
"In-process W2 publishes `/clock` from a separate on-demand graph "
"`ROS_Clock`: `evaluationMode=OnDemand`, "
"`pipelineStage=pipelineStageOnDemand`, `OnPhysicsStep` → `PublishClock`, "
"`IsaacReadSimulationTime` with `resetOnStop=1` "
"([`fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2-robot-"
"usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda)). `OnPhysicsStep` does not "
"run in the automatic `ROS_Control` graph, so the clock graph stays beside"
" it. `ROS_Control` still uses `OnPlaybackTick` to start "
"`ROS2ControlLaunch` once."
msgstr ""
"进程内的 W2 用旁边单独的 `ROS_Clock` 图发布 "
"`/clock`：`evaluationMode=OnDemand`，`pipelineStage=pipelineStageOnDemand`，`OnPhysicsStep`"
" → `PublishClock`，`IsaacReadSimulationTime` 的 "
"`resetOnStop=1`（[`fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/fiveages-gen2-robot-"
"usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda`)）。`OnPhysicsStep` 不会在自动的 "
"`ROS_Control` 图里跑，所以时钟图放在旁边。`ROS_Control` 仍用 `OnPlaybackTick` 把 "
"`ROS2ControlLaunch` 启动一次。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:69
#: 26c46ee9a5b14eecbe36a9437efa7c9b
msgid ""
"The topic-bridge payload on the same robot "
"([`ros2.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2-robot-"
"usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda)) still drives `PublishClock` "
"from `OnPlaybackTick` and sets `resetOnStop=0`."
msgstr ""
"同一台机器人的话题桥载荷（[`ros2.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2"
"-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda)）仍从 `OnPlaybackTick` 驱动 "
"`PublishClock`，并把 `resetOnStop` 设为 0。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:73
#: aae16aa6d37c41da96b19915fe94f62c
msgid ""
"`arms_target_manager`, when the node spawns it, is a host process with "
"`use_sim_time:=false` so markers are not tied to the physics step."
msgstr "节点若拉起 `arms_target_manager`，它是宿主机进程，`use_sim_time:=false`，标记不跟物理步绑定。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:75
#: 8a62d92fd7cb434db4d12b6e4c1e6aa4
msgid "TF"
msgstr "TF"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:77
#: 533ddb7744d947f199c52ba1570bb180
msgid ""
"Isaac’s odometry graph publishes `world → odom → base_*` and `/odom`. It "
"does not publish the whole URDF tree. `robot_state_publisher` publishes "
"`base_footprint → base_link` (when both links exist) and the arm tree, "
"including fixed frames such as `right_eef`."
msgstr ""
"Isaac 的里程计图发布 `world → odom → base_*` 和 `/odom`。它不发布整棵 URDF "
"树。`robot_state_publisher` 发布 `base_footprint → "
"base_link`（两个连杆都存在时）以及手臂树，包括 `right_eef` 这类固定帧。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:81
#: 2bb160eb89c84d6b929a1e0475b165bf
msgid "Several robots"
msgstr "多台机器人"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:83
#: b8c60e01ed564a5ea38ddd2a57efad24
msgid ""
"One ArticulationRoot, one `ROS2ControlLaunch`, and one controller manager"
" per robot. Isolation is the graph `namespace` plus relative topic names "
"(`cmd_vel`, `fsm_command`, `robot_description`). `/clock` stays global."
msgstr ""
"每台机器人一个 ArticulationRoot、一个 `ROS2ControlLaunch`、一个控制器管理器。隔离靠图的 "
"`namespace` 加上相对话题名（`cmd_vel`、`fsm_command`、`robot_description`）。`/clock`"
" 保持全局。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:85
#: 53907df20ae048f297f6b7175308625d
msgid ""
"A ROS namespace remaps topics (`/<ns>/tf`, `/<ns>/tf_static`). It does "
"not prefix `frame_id`. Each tree still has frames named `world`, `odom`, "
"and `base_link`. `world → odom` is that robot’s latched spawn pose on "
"**its** `/<ns>/tf`, not a rewritten frame called `g1d/world`. RViz "
"listens to `/tf` unless you remap it, for example:"
msgstr ""
"ROS 命名空间会重映射话题（`/<ns>/tf`、`/<ns>/tf_static`）。它不会给 `frame_id` "
"加前缀。每棵树里的帧名仍是 `world`、`odom` 和 `base_link`。`world → odom` 是这台机器人在**自己的** "
"`/<ns>/tf` 上锁存的出生位姿，不是改名为 `g1d/world` 的帧。RViz 默认听 `/tf`，需要时再重映射，例如："

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:87
#: 84e77eda599f4430905ff8d19a331225
msgid ""
"ros2 run tf2_ros tf2_echo world base_link --ros-args \\\n"
"  -r /tf:=/<ns>/tf -r /tf_static:=/<ns>/tf_static"
msgstr ""
"ros2 run tf2_ros tf2_echo world base_link --ros-args \\\n"
"  -r /tf:=/<ns>/tf -r /tf_static:=/<ns>/tf_static"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:92
#: dac62aef54504ab493c799b5af25a41e
msgid ""
"`<ns>` is the string on that graph’s `namespace` input, not a "
"`demo.launch.py` argument. A stage with one graph and one controller "
"manager per robot has been run."
msgstr ""
"`<ns>` 是该图 `namespace` 输入上的字符串，不是 `demo.launch.py` "
"的参数。一个舞台、每台机器人一张图和一个控制器管理器，已经跑通过。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:94
#: 6807b08c51f541f49911861f82c3b9f6
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr "Navigation"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:96
#: 9c82e9c7d7e440bea3494c5ed8f87695
msgid ""
"`NavigationLaunch` ([`OgnNavigationLaunch.ogn`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/exts/fasim.ros2.nodes/fasim/ros2/nodes/ogn/python/nodes/OgnNavigationLaunch.ogn))"
" starts `ros2 launch robot_common_launch navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py` "
"on Play when `enabled` is true. W2’s fiveages graph leaves `enabled` "
"false."
msgstr ""
"`NavigationLaunch`（[`OgnNavigationLaunch.ogn`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/blob/main/exts/fasim.ros2.nodes/fasim/ros2/nodes/ogn/python/nodes/OgnNavigationLaunch.ogn)）在"
" `enabled` 为 true 时，于播放后启动 `ros2 launch robot_common_launch "
"navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py`。W2 的 fiveages 图把 `enabled` 留为 false。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:98
#: b763c8cbe549495aa49268d9b0f2b6df
msgid ""
"`map` and `paramsFile` are paths relative to the opened stage root, so an"
" `env/` layer can point at `../../maps/<name>/map.yaml` stored in the "
"same [fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) "
"project. The node does not call composer `ros2-stack`. Default "
"`nav2Profile` is `map_only`. `publishMapWorldTf` defaults true (map drawn"
" in USD world). `publishMapOdomTf` defaults false because odometry comes "
"from Isaac."
msgstr ""
"`map` 和 `paramsFile` 相对已打开的舞台根解析，因此 `env/` 层可以指向同一 [fa-project-"
"usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) 项目里的 "
"`../../maps/<name>/map.yaml`。该节点不调用编排器的 `ros2-stack`。默认 `nav2Profile` 是 "
"`map_only`。`publishMapWorldTf` 默认 true（地图画在 USD 世界里）。`publishMapOdomTf` "
"默认 false，因为里程计来自 Isaac。"

