#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:3
#: 959b1549a92e41d1ae1c4d7d41648a57
msgid ""
"FaSim-Isaac is the Isaac Sim workspace: robot and scene USD, an optional "
"Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy overlay, and the extensions that start 运控 inside Sim."
msgstr ""
"FaSim-Isaac 是 Isaac Sim 工作区：机器人和场景 USD、可选的 Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy 叠加，以及在 Sim "
"里启动运控的扩展。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:5
#: fd0f842d70654d8db0593c0925ff2e0d
msgid ""
"Use this page when you need to see why a joint topic, a clock, or a TF "
"edge behaves the way it does. To start Sim and pick a launch, follow "
"[Isaac Sim](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)."
msgstr ""
"想看清一条关节话题、时钟或 TF 边为什么是这样时，读这一页。要启动 Sim 并选择 launch，按 [Isaac "
"Sim](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:7
#: 225346d5571c44ddb9705578cd780d6d
msgid ""
"**Repository:** [fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/FaSim-Isaac) `main` (`3606dc89`, 2026-11-13). In-process ros2_control"
" is on `main` ([#7](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac/pull/7), "
"`1a4193a3`). Replicator capture (`exts/fasim.replicator.sdg`) is on "
"`feature/ros2-control-node`, not on `main`."
msgstr ""
"**仓库：** [fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac) 的 `main`（`3606dc89`，2026-11-13）。进程内 ros2_control 在 `main` "
"上（[#7](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/FaSim-"
"Isaac/pull/7)，`1a4193a3`）。Replicator 采集（`exts/fasim.replicator.sdg`）在 "
"`feature/ros2-control-node`，不在 `main`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:13
#: f6d46350ba0943c2aa1bc4652f2387b4
msgid ""
"One stage uses one of these. `isaac` is the topic bridge you pass on a "
"ROS 2 launch. `isaac_sim` is set inside Isaac when Play starts the in-"
"process node. It is not a `demo.launch.py` flag, and it is not a second "
"robot body."
msgstr ""
"一个舞台用下面两种之一。`isaac` 是你在 ROS 2 launch 上传的话题桥。`isaac_sim` 是 Play 启动进程内节点时在 "
"Isaac 里设置的。它不是 `demo.launch.py` 的参数，也不是第二台机器人。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md
#: 694275c5e7e54159a1fef5785ae7a0b1
msgid "`emit_control` inside `ROS2ControlLaunch`"
msgstr "`ROS2ControlLaunch` 内部的 `emit_control`"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md
#: 3aad5e809d61412ea0396e692a649dd9
msgid "The articulation in the Isaac process"
msgstr "Isaac 进程里的关节体"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:20
#: 396773ca851249658fca9165bd0b6fe0
msgid ""
"Both keys are in the shared "
"[`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)"
" and in the [`robot_common_launch` README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot-descriptions-common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/README.md). "
"`hardware:=isaac` writes `/isaac/joint_command` and "
"`/isaac/joint_states`. `hardware:=isaac_sim` writes `<param "
"name=\"prim_path\">` from the launch argument `isaac_prim_path`, which is"
" the ArticulationRoot. `use_sim_time` is true for `gz`, `isaac`, and "
"`isaac_sim` unless you pass the launch argument as `true` or `false` "
"([`launch_arg_utils.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/robot_common_launch/common/launch_arg_utils.py))."
msgstr ""
"两个键都在共享的 [`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)"
" 和 [`robot_common_launch` README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/README.md) "
"里。`hardware:=isaac` 写成 `/isaac/joint_command` 和 "
"`/isaac/joint_states`。`hardware:=isaac_sim` 把 `<param "
"name=\"prim_path\">` 写成 launch 参数 `isaac_prim_path`，也就是 "
"ArticulationRoot。除非你把 launch 参数明确写成 `true` 或 `false`，否则 `gz`、`isaac` 和 "
"`isaac_sim` 的 `use_sim_time` 都是 "
"true（[`launch_arg_utils.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/robot_common_launch/common/launch_arg_utils.py)）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:22
#: 3c95ae98d36f423c9a20be39dbaff416
msgid ""
"If a robot xacro whitelists `validated_hardware_type`, include "
"`isaac_sim`. Otherwise that xacro fails on purpose when the in-process "
"node starts."
msgstr ""
"如果机器人 xacro 用白名单限制了 `validated_hardware_type`，要把 `isaac_sim` "
"写进去。否则进程内节点启动时，这份 xacro 会故意失败。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:24
#: dba4d4055b86440c92b48f426dc599fa
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`{hardware}.yaml` is merged only when the file exists. "
"`load_robot_config` applies files in this order: common, type yaml, "
"`{variant}.yaml`, end-effector compose, `{hardware}.yaml`, then "
"`control.patch` ([`robot_utils.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/robot_common_launch/common/robot_utils.py))."
" The hardware file comes after compose so a later compose pass does not "
"drop gripper keys from `isaac.yaml` ([robot-descriptions-common "
"#41](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-common/pull/41))."
" `isaac_sim` can reuse `isaac.yaml`. `emit_control` passes "
"`hardware_yaml=isaac`. A file named `isaac_sim.yaml` is loaded when the "
"launch hardware string is `isaac_sim`."
msgstr ""
"`{hardware}.yaml` 只在文件存在时才合并。`load_robot_config` 按这个顺序套用：common、类型 "
"yaml、`{variant}.yaml`、末端组合、`{hardware}.yaml`，然后是 "
"`control.patch`（[`robot_utils.py`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/robot_common_launch/common/robot_utils.py)）。硬件文件放在组合之后，这样后面的组合不会丢掉"
" `isaac.yaml` 里的夹爪键（[robot-descriptions-common #41](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-common/pull/41)）。`isaac_sim` 可以复用 "
"`isaac.yaml`。`emit_control` 传入 `hardware_yaml=isaac`。launch 的硬件字符串是 "
"`isaac_sim` 时，才会加载名为 `isaac_sim.yaml` 的文件。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:26
#: 45749d7f47384eea927215344f5a92ad
msgid "Topic names follow the robot"
msgstr "话题名跟这台机器人走"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:28
#: b20d1bdacb4d4be3ad01ab23b080488e
msgid ""
"The shared macro’s `/isaac/joint_*` pair is the topic-bridge default. "
"Acone uses that macro. W2’s topic-bridge graph publishes `/joint_command`"
" and `/joint_states` ([`ros2.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/fiveages-gen2-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda)). The "
"xacro `<param>` and the graph `topicName` are the same strings. "
"`demo.launch.py` has no namespace argument that rewrites them."
msgstr ""
"共享宏的 `/isaac/joint_*` 是话题桥的默认值。Acone 用的就是这个宏。W2 的话题桥图发布 `/joint_command` "
"和 `/joint_states`（[`ros2.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-"
"gen2-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/ros2.usda)）。xacro 的 `<param>` "
"和图的 `topicName` 是同一组字符串。`demo.launch.py` 没有能改写它们的 namespace 参数。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:30
#: e5f9ad7abdc84480a60c8a2de91b701d
msgid ""
"In-process W2 ([`fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/fiveages-gen2-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda)) does "
"not bridge body or arm `JointState` topics. The controller manager owns "
"those joints. Chassis `cmd_vel` and `odom` stay on the child ROS graph."
msgstr ""
"进程内的 W2（[`fiveages.usda`](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fiveages-gen2"
"-robot-usds/blob/main/W2/payloads/ROS/fiveages.usda)）不桥接身体或手臂的 "
"`JointState` 话题。这些关节归控制器管理器。底盘的 `cmd_vel` 和 `odom` 仍在子 ROS 图上。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:47
#: 63205b39d102436192a2b13b7ebe71fd
msgid ""
"`emit_control` builds one xacro URDF and points both the controller "
"manager and `/robot_description` at it. `Ros2ControlManager.setup` is "
"called with `publish_robot_description=False`, so the manager does not "
"publish that topic a second time. `robot_state_publisher` on the host "
"publishes `/robot_description` and the URDF TF tree. If that process does"
" not start, a latched `fasim_robot_description` publisher is the "
"fallback. The resource manager therefore loads the description once."
msgstr ""
"`emit_control` 生成一份 xacro URDF，并让控制器管理器和 `/robot_description` "
"都指向它。`Ros2ControlManager.setup` 以 `publish_robot_description=False` "
"调用，所以管理器不会再发一次这个话题。主机上的 `robot_state_publisher` 发布 `/robot_description` 和"
" URDF 的 TF 树。这个进程没起来时，锁存的 `fasim_robot_description` "
"发布者作为后备。资源管理器因此只加载一次描述。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:49
#: c48d65450e85491b803ddc039a8f4bb0
msgid ""
"Play does not rebuild a URDF from the stage on every start. The node "
"reuses the description xacro, and it falls back to synthesizing a URDF "
"from the USD only for an unexpected prim."
msgstr "Play 不会在每次启动时从舞台重新生成 URDF。节点复用描述 xacro，只有遇到意外图元时才退回去从 USD 合成 URDF。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:53
#: e6e3c839b32e431c89d92472ba9f3956
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`ocs2_arm_controller` declares `recompile_libraries` with default true "
"when `task.info` does not set `recompileLibraries` "
"([`CtrlComponent.h`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/include/ocs2_arm_controller/control/CtrlComponent.h))."
" The library folder is "
"`${OCS2_PLANNING_URDF_DIR:-/tmp}/ocs2_ros2/<robot>/ocs2/<content-hash>`."
msgstr ""
"`ocs2_arm_controller` 在 `task.info` 没有设置 `recompileLibraries` 时，把 "
"`recompile_libraries` 的默认值声明为 true（[`CtrlComponent.h`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/include/ocs2_arm_controller/control/CtrlComponent.h)）。库目录是"
" `${OCS2_PLANNING_URDF_DIR:-/tmp}/ocs2_ros2/<robot>/ocs2/<content-hash>`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:55
#: 2f4e210903654dbe8d3270d78105c0ef
msgid ""
"On the in-process path, `emit_control` then sets `recompile_libraries: "
"false` on the main controller only: `ocs2_arm_controller` for `demo` and "
"`split_body`, `ocs2_wbc_controller` for `full_body`. A topic-bridge "
"launch (`hardware:=isaac`) does not run `emit_control`, so it keeps the "
"controller default. That default stays true unless that robot’s info file"
" or YAML already says false."
msgstr ""
"在进程内这条路径上，`emit_control` 接着只把主控制器的 `recompile_libraries` 设为 false：`demo` "
"和 `split_body` 是 `ocs2_arm_controller`，`full_body` 是 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`。话题桥 launch（`hardware:=isaac`）不跑 "
"`emit_control`，所以保留控制器默认值。除非这台机器人的 info 或 YAML 已经写成 false，否则默认仍是 true。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:57
#: c48d65450e85491b803ddc039a8f4bb0
msgid ""
"A simulated robot that runs 运控 inside Isaac starts faster for two "
"reasons: the node reuses the description xacro, and it reuses this CppAD "
"cache."
msgstr "仿真机器人在 Isaac 里跑运控时，启动更快有两个原因：节点复用描述 xacro，并且复用这份 CppAD 缓存。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:61
#: 4e70afe87b62425cb579e3fcfcdfdfe4
msgid ""
"`infoFile` overrides `info_file_name` on the main controller. "
"`fixed_base_tcp` drops the virtual chassis degrees of freedom "
"(`manipulatorModelType` 0), so whole-body planning covers the body and "
"the arms."
msgstr ""
"`infoFile` 覆盖主控制器上的 `info_file_name`。`fixed_base_tcp` "
"去掉虚拟底盘自由度（`manipulatorModelType` 为 0），全身规划就只覆盖身体和手臂。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:63
#: f5256f78d9994b0bae343d1cca7ab63f
msgid ""
"`emit_control` warns when `mode` is `full_body` and the override name "
"contains `fixed_base`. The planner then has `basePlan=0`, so a runtime "
"`BASE_LOCK` has nothing to constrain, and arm enable can stay in "
"`WAITING_FOR_ENABLE_POLICY`. Lock the base with `mobile_base_tcp` and "
"`BASE_LOCK`."
msgstr ""
"`mode` 是 `full_body` 且覆盖文件名含有 `fixed_base` 时，`emit_control` 会警告。此时规划器 "
"`basePlan=0`，运行时的 `BASE_LOCK` 没有东西可约束，手臂使能会停在 "
"`WAITING_FOR_ENABLE_POLICY`。锁底盘用 `mobile_base_tcp` 和 `BASE_LOCK`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:65
#: 11db776e7ed4467d914252d571dc4b88
msgid ""
"`full_body` loads `ocs2_wbc_controller` from the GitHub Release package "
"`ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` (`./init_repo.sh` with arms set to `d`, or "
"`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only arms`). The same package contains "
"`ocs2_humanoid` and `lina_planning`. It is not an apt package, and it is "
"not `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control-full`. Open [ocs2-wbc-"
"controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ocs2-wbc-controller) when you"
" need to read or change the source."
msgstr ""
"`full_body` 从 GitHub Release 包 `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control` 加载 "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller`（`./init_repo.sh` 里 arms 选 `d`，或 "
"`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only arms`）。同一个包里还有 `ocs2_humanoid` 和 "
"`lina_planning`。它不是 apt 包，也不是 `ros-jazzy-arms-ros2-control-"
"full`。要读源码或改源码时再打开 [ocs2-wbc-controller](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/ocs2-wbc-controller)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:73
#: b36c6a79eaac495cb19a3d0332fd8ee6
msgid ""
"`/clock` is the controller’s time base when `use_sim_time` is true. A "
"clock that ticks once per rendered frame jumps several physics steps, so "
"a timed move finishes early. Use the physics-step clock. Changing joint "
"gains does not fix that. New in-process payloads follow the same "
"`ROS_Clock` pattern. This page checks it on W2. Odometry graphs keep "
"their own `ReadSimTime` (`resetOnStop=1`) so `odom` stamps stay valid. "
"Put cameras on the scene payload, not on this clock graph."
msgstr ""
"`use_sim_time` 为 true 时，`/clock` "
"是控制器的时间基准。每渲染一帧跳一次的时钟会一次跨过好几个物理步，定时动作就会提前结束。改用按物理步走的时钟。改关节增益修不好。新的进程内载荷沿用同一套"
" `ROS_Clock`。本页在 W2 上核对过。里程计图保留自己的 `ReadSimTime`（`resetOnStop=1`），这样 "
"`odom` 的时间戳仍然有效。相机放在场景载荷上，不要放在这个时钟图上。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:81
#: 39ac1bc5fafe40ee8def356db84a68f3
msgid ""
"On in-process W2 the ArticulationRoot is `base_link` "
"(`/FiveAges_W2/base_link`). That payload’s odometry chain is `world → "
"odom → base_footprint`, and `robot_state_publisher` publishes "
"`base_footprint → base_link`. OCS2 `baseFrame` is the link named in that "
"planner’s `task.info`. `base_footprint` sits on the ground. `base_link` "
"can sit above it. Two publishers on one edge fight. A standing model with"
" no `base_footprint` uses `base_link` for that chain. Read the link names"
" in the robot’s USD and `task.info` before you copy the W2 names."
msgstr ""
"进程内 W2 的 ArticulationRoot 是 "
"`base_link`（`/FiveAges_W2/base_link`）。这份载荷的里程计链是 `world → odom → "
"base_footprint`，`robot_state_publisher` 发布 `base_footprint → "
"base_link`。OCS2 的 `baseFrame` 是这份规划器 `task.info` 里写的那根连杆。`base_footprint`"
" 贴地。`base_link` 可以在它上方。一条边上有两个发布者就会抢。没有 `base_footprint` 的站立模型，这条链用 "
"`base_link`。抄 W2 的名字之前，先看这台机器人 USD 和 `task.info` 里的连杆名。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:104
#: 630086b536694d4ab497fe286b8d14fb
msgid ""
"[fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) is a "
"private repository. On `main`, a project is `scene.usd(a)`, `objects/`, "
"and a runnable `env/` ([README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-"
"project-usd/blob/main/README.md))."
msgstr ""
"[fa-project-usd](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-usd) 是私有仓库。在 "
"`main` 上，一个项目是 `scene.usd(a)`、`objects/` 和可运行的 "
"`env/`（[README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-project-"
"usd/blob/main/README.md)）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/2-fasim_isaac.md:106
#: e88786b0fbcb4cd198461943d13ac3d0
msgid ""
"The files the orchestrator reads next to those scenes (`robot.yaml`, "
"`task_configs/`, and `maps/` or `map/`) are on branch `feature/sinopec-"
"test-tube-picking`. That branch was ahead of `main` and not merged when "
"these pages were checked on 2026-11-13. Three projects there use this "
"layout: `Fiveages/2026-11 Standard Moving Boxes`, `Siemens/2026-06 Wind "
"Turbine Blade Detection`, and `Aimbo/2026-04 Bosch German&Poland POC`. "
"You need access to open the branch. The public way to run a project "
"directory is [lerobot_ros2 "
"`examples/IsaacSim/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/main/examples/IsaacSim/README.md): `motion-"
"generation` with `LEROBOT_ROOT` set. Keep camera rigs in the scene USD."
msgstr ""
"编排器在这些场景旁边读取的文件（`robot.yaml`、`task_configs/`，以及 `maps/` 或 `map/`）在分支 "
"`feature/sinopec-test-tube-picking` 上。这些页面核对时（2026-11-13），该分支领先 `main` "
"且尚未合入。那里有三个项目用了这套布局：`Fiveages/2026-11 Standard Moving "
"Boxes`、`Siemens/2026-06 Wind Turbine Blade Detection` 和 `Aimbo/2026-04 "
"Bosch German&Poland POC`。打开这个分支需要权限。公开的跑法是 [lerobot_ros2 的 "
"`examples/IsaacSim/README.md`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/lerobot_ros2/blob/main/examples/IsaacSim/README.md)：设置 `LEROBOT_ROOT`"
" 后运行 `motion-generation`。相机安装保持在场景 USD 里。"

